# Smart Task Tracker (Django MVP)

A simple, lightweight task management web application built with Python and Django. This project implements standard CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations to manage daily tasks locally.

## Features
- Add new tasks.
- Toggle task completion status (done/pending).
- Delete tasks.
- Clean and responsive user interface with CSS styling.

## Prerequisites
- Python 3.x installed on your system.
- Django framework.

## How to Run Locally

1. Clone the repository or download the project files.
2. Open the project folder in your terminal.
3. Create and activate a virtual environment:
   ```bash
   python -m venv venv
   # On Windows:
   .\venv\Scripts\Activate